# Terraform — state, plans, locks, providers, generated logs
**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/tfplan
**/apply.log
**/apply-checklist.log
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/.terraformrc
**/terraform.rc

# Secrets — credentials must never be committed
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.bak
.env
.env.*

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Claude Code working directory
.claude/

# Legacy single-state layout (archived during the scale refactor)
terraform/_legacy_flat_layout/

# Lock files we DO want to commit (override the exclusion above):
# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT in .gitignore — it pins provider versions.
